  "description": "Ryu Jin is famous for being the CEO of an entertainment agency that looks more like a celebrity than a celebrity. Although he lacks nothing, he has one problem. He continues to receive rejected proposals from his lover and fellow actor, Cha Hyeonwook! In response to a proposal that has already been rejected for the nth time, Jin comes up with a trick. Seeing Jin like that, Hyunwook opens new eyes... \"Hyung, wait a minute. Take it off with your mouth, not your hands.\" \n\n(Source: Mr. Blue, translated)",
